{"availability":"available","full":"ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai","name":"traceaid-ai","description":"Python/FastAPI REST API diagnostics with redacted evidence, corrected cURL/Python requests, regression tests and an interactive sample demo.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T05:46:47Z","updated":"2026-10-12T03:51:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://manostsagkos.github.io/traceaid-ai/","topics":["api-diagnostics","developer-tools","fastapi","httpx","portfolio","pydantic","pytest","python"],"demo":"https://manostsagkos.github.io/traceaid-ai/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:23:26.825Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:23:26.825Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:23:26.825Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:45:14.138Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:33:05.945Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:27:03.002Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T13:23:26.825Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn failed REST API calls into an evidence-based diagnosis and a corrected, testable request.","TraceAid helps a developer turn a failed API call into an incident report: what the evidence supports, what to change, and how to reproduce the fix. It is a personal Python/FastAPI project with a shared API/CLI pipeline, typed contracts, secret redaction, and optional structured AI analysis.","The browser demo needs no account, installation, API key, or paid service. It explores six synthetic incidents. Reports and code templates come from the real Python rules engine at build time; GitHub Pages does not run the backend. The local application accepts custom evidence and can optionally use OpenAI or probe an explicitly enabled target."],"features":["Receive ranked findings from deterministic rules.","Optionally enrich the findings with a schema-validated AI analysis.","Copy corrected curl, Python, and pytest snippets.","Export the report as Markdown or JSON."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8e8aa67a38e81dd301a2f182628f3fe259f3c8268cb8bb37caa9854296435d7b","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:45:14.316Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:51:38.936Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn failed REST API calls into an evidence-based diagnosis and a corrected, testable request.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The browser demo needs no account, installation, API key, or paid service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The browser demo needs no account, installation, API key, or paid service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The browser demo needs no account, installation, API key, or paid service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"An OpenAI API key only if you want AI-enriched analysis","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Docker runtime and paid provider calls need separate deployment credentials/infrastructure; the automated suite does not claim to exercise them.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8e8aa67a38e81dd301a2f182628f3fe259f3c8268cb8bb37caa9854296435d7b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:51:38.937Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T03:51:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ManosTsagkos/traceaid-ai/blob/main/README.md","